Releases go here, one Markdown file per version.

Empty on purpose: nothing has shipped. /changelog reads this collection and
says so rather than showing an invented history.

Format:

    ---
    version: 0.1.0
    released: 2026-11-04
    summary: First public release.
    kind: minor
    ---

    ## Added
    - ...

    ## Fixed
    - ...

Delete this file once the first release lands.
